        "name": "Тихая сила Камчатки",
        "alternateName": "Тихая сила Камчатки. Как природа становится интерьером",
        "description": "Exhibition capsule at Russky Dom 2026, stand K62 (\"The Quiet Strength of Kamchatka. How nature becomes interior\"). The character of Kamchatka was told through light, matter, sound, scent, taste and touch, along a route of seven zones. Author of the capsule: Tokareva Design. Vargov®Design took part with light (\"Light as a work of art\") in zone 02 «Лёд и туман» (\"Ice and Mist\"); the composition shown was LC0556: a school of manta rays rising out of a wave. At the stand the ribbons were green, with points of warm light along their edges; the colour of the ribbon is chosen for each project.",
